      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oakwood%2C_Staten_Island"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "After the Verrazzano‑Narrows Bridge opened in 1964, Oakwood saw a rapid influx of middle‑class families seeking suburban tranquility.",
